ror_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5194840","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:10:32Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5195010","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5194840-1846651706687363","game_id":"steam-5194840","kind":"announcement","title":"Every Choice Matters — Exploring the Roguelite Map","summary":"Every Choice Matters — Exploring the Roguelite MapWinning fights is only half the battle in JUST PRESS SPACE. What you do between those fights can be just as important.I've been working on the roguelite map to give players more meaningful decisions throughout their runs. From upgrading your character and finding loot to accepting dangerous Blood Pacts, the route you choose helps shape the run.This post covers the full-game roguelite mode currently in development. The demo's Goblin Campaign and N","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:23:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687363","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5194840-1846651706677098","game_id":"steam-5194840","kind":"announcement","title":"Act 1 Enemy Showcase – Meet Your Opponents!","summary":"Act 1 Enemy Showcase – Meet Your Opponents!With the recent visual and audio overhaul of JUST PRESS SPACE, I've also been hard at work refining and expanding the enemies you'll encounter throughout Act 1.One of my main goals is to make every enemy feel unique, with their own attack patterns, special abilities, and mechanics that challenge players in different ways.Rather than simply increasing health or damage, I want each encounter to encourage players to learn, adapt, and master different aspec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:27:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677098","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5194840-1846018067939243","game_id":"steam-5194840","kind":"announcement","title":"JUST PRESS SPACE — HD Visual & Audio Overhaul Now Live","summary":"JUST PRESS SPACE — A Complete HD Visual & Audio Overhaul!Same brutal combat. A whole new atmosphere.Over the last few days, I've been hard at work giving JUST PRESS SPACE a complete visual and audio overhaul!My goal was to bring more depth and atmosphere to the game's 2D environments while maintaining the original pixel-art charm.And I'm excited to finally show you the results!What's New?HD Visual Effects: Improved lighting, post-processing, and environmental effects add a whole new level of dep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T19:41:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939243","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:15:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5194840-1846018067926712","game_id":"steam-5194840","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"Well... this is terrifying.The JUST PRESS SPACE demo is officially live.I've spent a long time working on this game, changing things, breaking things, fixing them again, and constantly wondering whether people would actually enjoy this ridiculous little idea I had.And now I finally have to let other people play it.I'm genuinely incredibly nervous putting this out there. When you've spent so long working on something mostly by yourself, eventually pressing that Release button feels a lot scarier ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:12:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/184601